# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Loose reference PDFs at the REPO ROOT (~199 MB) — reading material the
# maintainer dropped in, not inputs to the app or the tests. Nothing at runtime
# or in the suite reads them, and their provenance is already recorded in
# docs/sources.csv. Ignored so a clone stays small.
#
# NOTE the deliberate asymmetry (ruling 2026-07-16d, option 3): corpus/ IS
# tracked — both corpus/raw/*.pdf (~53 MB) and corpus/txt/*.txt. Those are the
# HARVESTED sources that back CITATION-LOG rows, so a citation can be re-verified
# from a clone alone. That's the whole point of the citation log; the root PDFs
# have no such job. This pattern is root-anchored (`/*.pdf`), so it does not
# reach corpus/raw/.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/*.pdf
